
How to build the project

1. Install dependencies, includeing cmake, cross-compile toolchain for your target.
2. Open CMakeLists.txt, modify the mysql client library path.
3. Goto 'build' directory, run 'run.sh', which will build the project and scp the executables to the targets, you can modify your target IP address here.


NOTE: 
1. To successfully run the cmake, you need to install gcc and g++.
2. See CMakeList.txt, you need to set the mysql client library path.
